{"4638580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doll Hero Thirty-Six", "steam_appid": 4638580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Doll Heroes Thirty-Six&quot;, you will take on the role of a lord charged with reviving a crumbling city. Everything lies in ruins, and you must start from scratch: recruit and manage residents with unique talents, develop a diversified economy including agriculture, mining, and commerce, as well as repair and upgrade key structures such as city defenses and housing. Nurture agriculture to breathe life back into the city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond city management, you must personally train your troops and recruit doll heroes (up to 36 heroes). Equip them with weapons, armor, and various side arms. Each hero has their own weapons and skills — you need to arrange them appropriately. When your strength is sufficient, lead your heroes on campaigns to reclaim vast lands occupied by monsters and rebels, challenge high-difficulty dungeons and secret realms, and defeat powerful bosses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every battle tests your strategy and on‑the‑fly command — position your formations wisely, make the best use of skills, and seize the right moments. As your territory expands and your city flourishes, you will gradually uncover the secrets of this world, and ultimately build an unbreakable, prosperous, and mighty city‑state. The road to revival is full of challenges, but it also holds boundless possibilities.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Doll Heroes Thirty-Six&quot;, you will take on the role of a lord charged with reviving a crumbling city. Everything lies in ruins, and you must start from scratch: recruit and manage residents with unique talents, develop a diversified economy including agriculture, mining, and commerce, as well as repair and upgrade key structures such as city defenses and housing. Nurture agriculture to breathe life back into the city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond city management, you must personally train your troops and recruit doll heroes (up to 36 heroes). Equip them with weapons, armor, and various side arms. Each hero has their own weapons and skills — you need to arrange them appropriately. When your strength is sufficient, lead your heroes on campaigns to reclaim vast lands occupied by monsters and rebels, challenge high-difficulty dungeons and secret realms, and defeat powerful bosses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every battle tests your strategy and on‑the‑fly command — position your formations wisely, make the best use of skills, and seize the right moments. As your territory expands and your city flourishes, you will gradually uncover the secrets of this world, and ultimately build an unbreakable, prosperous, and mighty city‑state. The road to revival is full of challenges, but it also holds boundless possibilities.</strong></p>", "short_description": "As a city lord, revive a ruined city: manage residents, develop economy, train troops, and lead generals to conquer lands, explore dungeons, and build a prosperous, powerful city.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638580/41753a2f8bfb6ac32d6d2b88357460de71cc8ff2/header.jpg?t=1778138948", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638580/98a7e2662e5631eb67ac3ad9f7d38dd1baa192db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778138948", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638580/98a7e2662e5631eb67ac3ad9f7d38dd1baa192db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778138948", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating sy